          "id": "Jade_TryndamereQ",
          "name": "Bloodlust",
          "description": "Tryndamere thrives on the thrills of combat, gaining Fury that increasing his Attack and Critical Strike Damage as he kills enemies and deals critical strikes. He can cast Bloodlust to consume his Fury and heal himself.",
          "tooltip": "<spellPassive>Passive</spellPassive>: Tryndamere thirsts for blood, gaining <keywordMajor>Fury</keywordMajor> every time he kills an enemy or deals a critical strike, giving him <physicalDamage>{{ adperstack }} Attack Damage</physicalDamage> and {{ critdamageperstack*100 }}% Critical Strike Damage per <keywordMajor>Fury</keywordMajor>.<br /><br /><spellActive>Active</spellActive>: Tryndamere consumes his <keywordMajor>Fury</keywordMajor>, restoring <healing>{{ initialheal }}, plus {{ healperfury }} Health</healing> per <keywordMajor>Fury</keywordMajor> consumed. (Max heal: <healing>{{ maxhealtooltip }}</healing>){{ spellmodifierdescriptionappend }}",
